    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wizard Blaster is a time survival roguelite. Create different builds to survive the hordes of enemies. Each run is new and offers different combination of spells to win. Can you make the best build?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Auto-firing spells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fast runs (under 10 minutes) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choose from different characters, that all bring their unique skills and stats to the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Replayability - Upgrades are offered at random, so you might not try all builds in one run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated levels: each run is different</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meta upgrades: customize each run with new upgrades.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wizard Blaster is a time survival roguelite. Create different builds to survive the hordes of enemies. Each run is new and offers different combination of spells to win. Can you make the best build?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Auto-firing spells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fast runs (under 10 minutes) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choose from different characters, that all bring their unique skills and stats to the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Replayability - Upgrades are offered at random, so you might not try all builds in one run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated levels: each run is different</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meta upgrades: customize each run with new upgrades.</p></li></ul>",
